# Row I5.5: the stage decision (decisions 14, 15). DecideCandidate plus being that opening's hiring manager. The recruiter reads
# the debrief and does not decide: 403 with that sentence (the route's own, before the action check). An interviewer lacks the
# action (403). Another opening's hiring manager: not found (404). An empty body is a 400 for the opening's hiring manager, so
# no line writes.
POST /api/interviews/applications/{applications.ingrid}/stage | recruiter=403 interviewer=403 interviewer2=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | hiringManager | {}
POST /api/interviews/applications/{applications.jonah}/stage | recruiter=403 interviewer=403 interviewer2=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | hiringManager | {}
# Ravi applied to iOS, whose hiring manager is not Amara: for her it does not exist.
POST /api/interviews/applications/{applications.ravi}/stage | hiringManager recruiter=403 interviewer=403 interviewer2=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | | {}
POST /api/interviews/applications/app-nonexistent/stage | recruiter hiringManager interviewer=403 interviewer2=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | | {}
